# Ghidra headless output. Regenerated from a personal copy of RC Cars by the
# scripts in this directory (DumpNamedFunctions.java, DumpAssetLoaders.java,
# ...). Decompiled game code -- must not be redistributed. The .java scripts
# that produce it are tracked.
*.named.c
*.named_index.txt
*.candidates.c
*.functions.csv
*.strings_xref.txt
*.gpr
*.rep/

# Game-derived data dumped by the unpack/analysis scripts. Same rule: generated
